@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Notification Methods class isolation boundary
component "AAA test" as Test
rectangle "Class SUT" {
 component "Real Notification Service" as Service
}
component "Sending Notification" as Mechanism
Test --> Service : inputs / assertions
Service --> Mechanism


note bottom of Service
  "Notification Service" in this graph is a stand-in
  for the different implementations of
  INotificationService that will need their
  specific behaviour tested.
end note

note bottom of Mechanism
  "Sending Notification" is a stand-in for what would be the specific notification channel protocol (SMS, e-mail, webhook (https))
end note
@enduml